From: Codex Executor <codex-executor@local>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 07:48:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/22] Sheet surface robustness on near-degenerate cells (Step
 4): remesh-then-clip, orientation-based caps, verified self-intersection gate

Surface pipeline (sheet_solid_surface.py):
- remesh the sheet clipped 1.5h outside every plane, then clip exactly (boundary on the planes to round-off, exact
  box corners); resnap/corner restoration are off the production path
- sliver control after clipping: constrained near-plane snapping, guarded short-edge collapse anywhere on the sheet
  (plane subset rule, link condition, fold-over and needle guards), needle repair by collapse/flip, duplicate-vertex
  merge, late flat-triangle drop
- in-plane Newton projection with a step cap and a tangency guard (no vertex flies along a plane where the sheet is
  tangent to it)
- cap material side from the sheet orientation (-n x t per chain edge) instead of level sampling next to the chain;
  the level is only a diagnostic; label conflicts are counted
- self-intersection gate: pymeshlab candidates verified pairwise with an exact triangle/triangle test, fold-over
  pairs on the open sheet; deterministic retry ladder on the remesh size (x0.9, x1.12, x0.8); fail closed
- general T-junction repair on the closed surface; one Gmsh volume per closed shell; EmptyCellError for empty cells
- cut-plane re-snap after the projections, collapse of sheet edges lying along a plane line, void unseeded cap
  regions on port faces, Gmsh isolated in a child process (a crash is a RuntimeError, not a dead worker)
- resolution follows the thinnest wall (0.184 tau_min): remesh size <= 0.6 t_min, marching-cubes grid >= 3 cells
  per t_min

Schur (tet10_label.py): skip carrier columns without fine support in the Pardiso solve (operator identical to the
bit, 75 s -> 33 s on G0 fast).

produce_sheet_label.py refuses a self-intersecting surface; the receipt carries the effective resolution.

New scripts: sheet_surface_check.py (one-cell surface/Gmsh robustness check, JSON line) and
make_sheet_stress_population.py (342-cell near-degenerate stress population).  Tests: exact triangle test,
T-junction repair, collapse guards, thin cut cell end-to-end (9 tests).

Evidence in artifacts/.../sheet_true_geometry_label_route_v1/STEP4_ROBUSTNESS_REPORT.md: G5 convergence row
complete (0.77% / 0.39%), rho = 0.1 cell converges at 0.33% / 0.17% with the scaled resolution, 16 pilot cells
14 PASS + 2 EMPTY, stress population results attached.
